      <div class="eyebrow">What changed</div>
      <h2>Engineering became the foundation for product and commercial leadership.</h2>
      <p>As the business grew, the work expanded beyond keeping the network running. The subsequent Internet Africa / UUNET story describes the move into product development, commercial modelling, business development and broader technology leadership.</p>
      <div class="tags"><span>Internet</span><span>Networks</span><span>ISP</span><span>Product</span><span>Commercial strategy</span></div>
